He said he planted booby traps because he didn't like the way

503
00:30:09,580 --> 00:30:13,880
the government created laws that he felt manipulated lives.

504
00:30:13,980 --> 00:30:17,840
Buying the parts to put his booby traps together was easy.

505
00:30:17,940 --> 00:30:22,080
Luke Helder, like so many other makers of booby traps,

506
00:30:22,180 --> 00:30:24,720
was able to purchase all of the components

507
00:30:24,721 --> 00:30:29,220
the components for his deadly devices simply by going to local

508
00:30:29,221 --> 00:30:32,660
stores and purchasing over-the-counter the supplies,

509
00:30:32,661 --> 00:30:34,320
the equipment that he needed.

510
00:30:34,321 --> 00:30:35,420
There was no license.

511
00:30:35,421 --> 00:30:38,620
There was no identity check.

512
00:30:38,621 --> 00:30:40,960
He told authorities the placement of the bombs

513
00:30:40,961 --> 00:30:44,520
in mailboxes across the country was to create a smiley face

514
00:30:44,521 --> 00:30:48,220
on the US map.

515
00:30:48,221 --> 00:30:50,860
Reports of booby traps killing or injuring victims

516
00:30:50,861 --> 00:30:54,860
increased 60% over the past decade.

517
00:30:54,960 --> 00:30:58,360
Surprisingly, most were guarding pot farms or meth labs

518
00:30:58,460 --> 00:31:03,000
from thieves and police.

519
00:31:03,100 --> 00:31:05,700
Many marijuana farms, especially in the western U.S.,

520
00:31:05,800 --> 00:31:08,420
rely on well-placed booby traps for protection.

521
00:31:08,520 --> 00:31:11,020
One of the most common and more deadly booby traps

522
00:31:11,120 --> 00:31:14,620
that we find around marijuana patches is the shotgun-type trap.

523
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:18,260
It's made out of a Kutman rat trap, wood, and a 3-quarter

524
00:31:18,360 --> 00:31:20,420
inch diameter plumbing pipe.

525
00:31:20,421 --> 00:31:26,980
What the booby trapper does is insert a shotgun shell into the plumbing pipe, finds a suitable

526
00:31:26,981 --> 00:31:32,146
support like a stump, attaches the wood to the stump, brings the bale around.

527
00:31:32,147 --> 00:31:33,220
The unsuspecting

528
00:31:33,221 --> 00:31:39,380
officer comes down the trail, hits the wire, causes the pin to slip out, and it fires the device.

529
00:31:41,060 --> 00:31:46,580
Less deadly but exceptionally painful, are booby traps designed to harass law enforcement

530
00:31:46,581 --> 00:31:51,280
or intimidate thieves wanting to steal the marijuana plants.

531
00:31:51,380 --> 00:31:54,680
One thing we'll typically see is either single or double-edged

532
00:31:54,780 --> 00:31:59,420
razor blades, which are placed down in the stock of a marijuana

533
00:31:59,520 --> 00:32:00,220
plant.

534
00:32:00,320 --> 00:32:02,820
It deters people from just reaching in and grabbing the

535
00:32:02,920 --> 00:32:04,740
plant and pulling it out, because they're going to get

536
00:32:04,840 --> 00:32:07,700
cut if they don't know it's there.

537
00:32:07,800 --> 00:32:10,240
There's another painful non-lethal trap out there

538
00:32:10,340 --> 00:32:12,940
that tears at the face.

539
00:32:13,040 --> 00:32:16,340
It's just a simple fish hook with fishing line attached

540
00:32:16,341 --> 00:32:19,940
You can see it's very, very sharp on the end and has barbs.

541
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:25,880
Where we'll typically find these is hanging on small branches.

542
00:32:25,980 --> 00:32:27,280
When you walk through here, they're

543
00:32:27,380 --> 00:32:30,580
going to either snag in your eye, in your cheek, your scalp,

544
00:32:30,680 --> 00:32:33,400
or somewhere along in your head area.

545
00:32:33,500 --> 00:32:34,800
And with the barbs on them, they're

546
00:32:34,900 --> 00:32:36,200
not going to come out very easily.

547
00:32:38,700 --> 00:32:40,640
Meth labs rigged with booby traps

548
00:32:40,740 --> 00:32:43,100
present another deadly challenge.

549
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,300
More than 18 law enforcement officers

550
00:32:45,301 --> 00:32:48,300
were killed and hundreds of others wounded in recent years,

551
00:32:48,301 --> 00:32:51,300
attempting to enter and close down these illicit operations.

552
00:32:51,301 --> 00:32:54,300
We have found shotgun booby traps behind doors

553
00:32:54,301 --> 00:32:57,300
where you open the door and it fires a shotgun.

554
00:32:57,301 --> 00:33:00,300
They're also finding a lot of chemical-type booby traps.

555
00:33:00,301 --> 00:33:04,300
Probably not going to kill them, but could seriously injure them

556
00:33:04,301 --> 00:33:07,300
and cause potential long-term damage.

557
00:33:07,301 --> 00:33:10,300
Not all booby traps are meant to kill or injure.

558
00:33:10,301 --> 00:33:13,300
Some are to provide early warning.

559
00:33:13,301 --> 00:33:17,300
A very simple device is nothing more than a tripwire, empty can,

560
00:33:17,301 --> 00:33:20,300
a handful of pebbles. Pebbles go in the can.

561
00:33:20,301 --> 00:33:23,300
Officer comes down a trail. He'll disturb the wire.

562
00:33:23,301 --> 00:33:27,300
Causes a rattling sound. Gives the pot farmers down the road

563
00:33:27,301 --> 00:33:32,300
an opportunity to get away. Experts agree that the chances

564
00:33:32,301 --> 00:33:37,300
are slim for the average citizen to be caught by a booby trap.

565
00:33:37,301 --> 00:33:41,300
But the same experts caution that it is possible, especially

566
00:33:41,301 --> 00:33:45,580
especially for hikers or bicyclists who innocently wander

567
00:33:45,680 --> 00:33:49,880
into a marijuana field on public lands.

568
00:33:49,980 --> 00:33:53,940
If you're in a national forest, if you're in a state park,

569
00:33:54,040 --> 00:33:57,420
there's the possibility that you could stumble onto an illegal

570
00:33:57,520 --> 00:34:00,160
marijuana grow that is booby-trapped with either

571
00:34:00,260 --> 00:34:06,120
