675
00:39:51,200 --> 00:39:53,940
the computers back at Redmond will figure that out,

676
00:39:54,040 --> 00:39:55,640
and the booby trap will be triggered,

677
00:39:55,740 --> 00:39:58,740
and the system will stop working.

678
00:39:58,840 --> 00:40:04,660
Microsoft's new high-tech way to stop software piracy.

679
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:06,860
But when it comes to disarming or just coping

680
00:40:06,960 --> 00:40:08,860
with booby traps, the military may

681
00:40:08,960 --> 00:40:13,500
be ahead of the computer whizzes, at least in a war zone.

