687
00:40:29,740 --> 00:40:33,860
The TRCs, called PACBOTs, established that value in test

688
00:40:33,960 --> 00:40:37,260
after test.

689
00:40:37,360 --> 00:40:41,060
Looking like miniature tanks stripped of their guns,

690
00:40:41,061 --> 00:40:45,560
